      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790976670560,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Drawn from haipipe-workbench-insight/ref/workbench-table.md. The number is the order inside a Space; · marks a view with no run; * marks a planned skill or agent. A question is written first; a run answers it, and the run's config names that question (answers: [QI2, …]).\nEach run names its skill. Creating a config never starts a run: the person presses Run.",
      "originalText": "Drawn from haipipe-workbench-insight/ref/workbench-table.md. The number is the order inside a Space; · marks a view with no run; * marks a planned skill or agent. A question is written first; a run answers it, and the run's config names that question (answers: [QI2, …]).\nEach run names its skill. Creating a config never starts a run: the person presses Run.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
