      "text": "GI0  the extract is recorded        🟡 MT00 partial\nGI1  each question has a row        ✅\nGI2  each answer cites its runs     ✅\nGI3  numbers match their run files  ⬜ check\nGI4  the Cross verdict is current   ✅ POOL\nGI5  the Wisdom answer is signed    ⬜ re-sign\nGI6  the register cell is settled   ✅",
      "originalText": "GI0  the extract is recorded        🟡 MT00 partial\nGI1  each question has a row        ✅\nGI2  each answer cites its runs     ✅\nGI3  numbers match their run files  ⬜ check\nGI4  the Cross verdict is current   ✅ POOL\nGI5  the Wisdom answer is signed    ⬜ re-sign\nGI6  the register cell is settled   ✅",
