      "text": "\n\n\n⌄ Task  Funnel rates\n  1 run · answers 9 more\n    D02 extract_profile\n      03 funnel_rates ▸ 1 run\n        smsr2v1  ok   ↗\n› Task  Funnel rates\n  1 run · smsr2v1 · ok\n\n\n\n\n› Runs behind it\n  5 runs, from the\n  questions it builds on\n\n\n\n—",
      "originalText": "\n\n\n⌄ Task  Funnel rates\n  1 run · answers 9 more\n    D02 extract_profile\n      03 funnel_rates ▸ 1 run\n        smsr2v1  ok   ↗\n› Task  Funnel rates\n  1 run · smsr2v1 · ok\n\n\n\n\n› Runs behind it\n  5 runs, from the\n  questions it builds on\n\n\n\n—",
