    },
    {
      "id": "one-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 3380,
      "width": 647.36,
      "height": 340.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 596397341,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 729709538,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790976670560,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. The workbench is born from one extract: MT00 names it, the banner\n   shows it on every Space, and there is no dataset switcher.\n\n2. A partition is a cut of that extract, never a second dataset:\n   one config per task, its population block names the cut.\n\n3. Task folders are shared functions. A config's store: line names\n   its board, so this workbench lists only its own calls\n   (smsr2v1, youngmale, … and not smsr3full).\n\n4. A config's answers: line names the questions its run answers.\n   That line joins the Logic side to the Work side.\n\n5. A new extract is a new workbench: SMSR3Full → A03. Round 3\n   checking round 2 is a comparison between two workbenches,\n   not a partition of either.",
      "originalText": "1. The workbench is born from one extract: MT00 names it, the banner\n   shows it on every Space, and there is no dataset switcher.\n\n2. A partition is a cut of that extract, never a second dataset:\n   one config per task, its population block names the cut.\n\n3. Task folders are shared functions. A config's store: line names\n   its board, so this workbench lists only its own calls\n   (smsr2v1, youngmale, … and not smsr3full).\n\n4. A config's answers: line names the questions its run answers.\n   That line joins the Logic side to the Work side.\n\n5. A new extract is a new workbench: SMSR3Full → A03. Round 3\n   checking round 2 is a comparison between two workbenches,\n   not a partition of either.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "change-title",
