      "updated": 1790976670560,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. The stem is the identity: config, ticket and result folder share rNN_<dataset>_<cut>.   2. The dataset and the cut live in the config, never in the code.\n3. The board decides the place: RESULT_STORE = the board's store; the result is RESULT_STORE/<block>/<job>/<task>/results/<run>/.   4. runtime.yaml writes the attachment down: config, input, store, git sha.",
      "originalText": "1. The stem is the identity: config, ticket and result folder share rNN_<dataset>_<cut>.   2. The dataset and the cut live in the config, never in the code.\n3. The board decides the place: RESULT_STORE = the board's store; the result is RESULT_STORE/<block>/<job>/<task>/results/<run>/.   4. runtime.yaml writes the attachment down: config, input, store, git sha.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
