      "text": "one thing?        the ask has no 'and', no list, one verb\nlogic follows?    the answer follows from these needs, and\n                  every need is used\nsmall?            three needs or fewer\nrung legal?       no cause at D or I; cites one rung below\nnew?              not a duplicate of a question already asked\nplaced?           parent and consumer named\n\nAGREE, or FIX with the exact split or wording;\na reviewer never reviews a question it shaped",
      "originalText": "one thing?        the ask has no 'and', no list, one verb\nlogic follows?    the answer follows from these needs, and\n                  every need is used\nsmall?            three needs or fewer\nrung legal?       no cause at D or I; cites one rung below\nnew?              not a duplicate of a question already asked\nplaced?           parent and consumer named\n\nAGREE, or FIX with the exact split or wording;\na reviewer never reviews a question it shaped",
